<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's CPP H1 profit down 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's CPP H1 profit down 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(In billions of escudos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net profit     2.17    vs    2.44</p>
<p>    Cashflow	     11.07    vs    6.94</p>
<p>    Financial margin   19.08    vs   14.46</p>
<p>    Banking activities 22.15    vs   16.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Credito Predial Portugues, controlled by Banco Totta &amp; Acores said the drop in net profit reflected a provision of 1.27 billion escudos against tax on profits.</p>
</text>
